				<text><![CDATA[Validation checks: (1) Specified categories are 'of which' items. Therefore, the sum for total face-to-face customers cannot be less than for the specified categories. (2) The sum of exempt and non-exempt customers should be the same as for the total face-to-face customers.]]></text>
